83
00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:43.000
And the bus is packed with pilgrims, most of whom are women. Oh, no. And it's overloaded with the pilgrim's luggage. And the Rangers, this time, they fire at the tires of the bus. disable the bus and they take all these women pilgrims off as prisoners. So, I mean, we're talking about dozens and dozens of people.

