And they're like, what are we going to do with all these women? And they put them on one of their transport planes and they say, well, we'll hold them on this transport plane at Desert 1 until the mission is over. So at midnight local time, they hear sound overhead and it's the helicopters, six of them. And they're more than an hour late. So the helicopters land. And now this sort of patch of desert is very crowded. You've got transport planes, you've got helicopters,

