because actually, you know, they leave behind in the desert. You know, they've left the smoldering records of the transport and the helicopter with the bodies in them. They've left four perfectly good helicopters behind. They've left the burning remains of an Iranian oil tanker and a bus full of Iranian pilgrims who are completely baffled and frightened. By what's going on? Yeah. Yeah, by what's encouraging.

