it's been 12 months for the hostages in captivity, yellow ribbons and all that. Yellow ribbons, the scenes of them are blindfolds, burning helicopters in the desert, it is the worst possible publicity. And at that point, I think some of his aides thought, we've lost this election. Because if that's what everybody is talking about, we're doomed. And they were right, because the next day, the Tuesday, Reagan won by almost 10%. He won 44 states to Carter's 6.

