00:55:24.000 --> 00:55:44.000
and then Tehran will release the hostages. Now Carter hasn't slept for days. He's been in the Oval Office sort of obsessing over all the details of these transactions. and he says to his aides, the hostages matter more to me than anything. He's not going to have a farewell party in the White House as people normally do. There's not going to be a drinks party

